-- A rule whose answer is not the same everywhere inside one bucket: the
-- allowance is a tenth of the income above 1000 and a twentieth of it
-- otherwise, so every income that is not above 1000 lands in one bucket and
-- gets its own answer. The report has to say so, not print one answer as if
-- it were the answer of the whole bucket.
GIVEN income IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `allowance` IS
  IF income GREATER THAN 1000 THEN income TIMES 0.1 ELSE income TIMES 0.05
